Flow of Agentic AI
==================

                 Generative AI (Gen AI)
                         │
                         ▼
              Large Language Model (LLM)
                         │
      ┌──────────────────┼──────────────────┐
      │                  │                  │
   OpenAI             Gemini             Llama
                         │
                         ▼
      Procedure-Based / Application-Based AI
                         │
        ┌───────────────┼───────────────┐
        │               │               │
       RAG         Agentic AI      LangChain

=========

Explanation of Each Component

| Component                                | Description                                                                                                        |
| ---------------------------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------ |
| **Gen AI**                               | Artificial Intelligence that generates text, images, code, audio, and more.                                        |
| **LLM (Large Language Model)**           | The core model that understands and generates natural language.                                                    |
| **OpenAI / Gemini / Llama**              | Different LLM providers/models used to build AI applications.                                                      |
| **Procedure-Based / Application-Based**  | Applications built on top of LLMs to solve real-world problems using predefined workflows and tools.               |
| **RAG (Retrieval-Augmented Generation)** | Enhances LLM responses by retrieving information from external documents or databases before generating an answer. |
| **Agentic AI**                           | Autonomous AI that plans, reasons, uses tools, and performs multiple steps to achieve a goal.                      |
| **LangChain**                            | A framework used to build LLM-powered applications by connecting prompts, memory, tools, APIs, and workflows.      |


==============

Relationship Between Them

| Technology     | Purpose                                                                    |
| -------------- | -------------------------------------------------------------------------- |
| **LLM**        | The intelligence (brain).                                                  |
| **RAG**        | Gives the LLM access to external knowledge.                                |
| **LangChain**  | Helps developers build AI applications and agent workflows.                |
| **Agentic AI** | Uses LLMs, RAG, memory, and tools together to complete tasks autonomously. |


===========

| Technology     | Example                                                                                                                                |
| -------------- | -------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |
| **LLM**        | Answers: "Which bus goes from Chennai to Madurai?"                                                                                     |
| **RAG**        | Retrieves the latest bus schedules from your CSV/database before answering.                                                            |
| **LangChain**  | Connects the LLM with the bus database, memory, and APIs.                                                                              |
| **Agentic AI** | Searches buses, compares fares, checks seat availability, books the ticket, processes payment, and sends a confirmation automatically. |


===========

Generative AI → Creates content.
LLM → Provides language understanding and generation.
RAG → Supplies up-to-date external knowledge to the LLM.
LangChain → Framework for building LLM-based applications and workflows.
Agentic AI → Builds on LLMs (often with RAG and frameworks like LangChain) to autonomously plan, reason, use tools, and complete complex goals.

============

Gen AI
   │
   ▼
LLM (OpenAI / Gemini / Llama)
   │
   ▼
Applications
   ├── RAG → Better knowledge
   ├── LangChain → Workflow framework
   └── Agentic AI → Autonomous decision-making and task execution

=========
